/// @defgroup gfx gfx
/// Drawing with SDL_GPU: the device, the swapchain, pipelines and frames (design doc 0002 §8). Each feature keeps its
/// pipelines and buffers in its own class under `internal/features/` (sprites, meshes, ribbons, seals, the composite); the
/// seals are laid out on the CPU (seal_draw.hpp) and drawn by the seal shaders, each layer's parts as distance fields: the
/// ground ones over the ground and decals, the upright and overhead ones over the creatures but under the swords' trails,
/// the overlay, text and the HUD.
